<title>MALAYSIA: Glenealy requests share suspension.</title>
<headline>Glenealy requests share suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glenealy Plantations (Malaya) Bhd requested that its shares be suspended from trading on the main board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange (KLSE) from December 20.</p>
<p>Company officials were unavailable to comment on a statement requesting the suspension, which was issued by the KLSE late on Thursday.</p>
<p>Glenealy's shares were last traded on December 16, closing at 8.90 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-2037509)</p>
</text>
